From 82ede1bf67231a86dca5dd384ed315f9a8f6832c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 0xFFshell <pieterr.games@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:12:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] port: Minecraft 26.2 (down from 26.3)

Revert the upstream 26.2->26.3 port commit 30176ed9 onto the 26.3 tip,
keeping the fork's version-independent work:

- keep VersionCompat seam call sites and Pair (Settings, BaritoneToast,
  BlockOptionalMeta, api Pair users untouched)
- keep available_loaders=fabric and mod_version=1.20.0; only swap versions
- gradle.properties tail (nether_pathfinder/mixin/asm) restored, required
  by build.gradle
- era metadata: fabric.mod.json minecraft [26.2] / fabricloader >=0.19.3,
  mods.toml versionRange=[26.2]
- swing form restored to era: LocalPlayer#swing(InteractionHand), which on
  26.2 sends ServerboundSwingPacket itself (no ServerboundPunchPacket exists)
- ButtonWritesTest adapted: SHAPES pins the swing call site, BUTTONS watches
  ServerboundSwingPacket, fidget skip renamed

Validation: compileJava/compileLaunchJava/compileTestJava EXIT=0;
./gradlew test 442 tests, 441 pass, 1 failure = ClickGatesTest
(pre-existing Windows path-separator bug, file byte-identical to 26.3).
